window.products.push({"id":525018,"name":"LinenMe Stone Washed Fitted Sheet, 39''x 75''x 14\", Off White","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":125.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91YIWrFElgL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"A pure linen fitted sheet your back will say thank you for! it is extremely soft, absorbs moisture quickly, dries fast, can be machine washed as frequently as needed and gets even softer after each wash.Temperature regulation - Linen has inherent seemingly magical properties which mean it will keep you warm on the coldest of nights, yet cool when it’s hot. Perfect for those days when it’s so cold your hands get freezing just holding your book and you want to hunker down with a hot water bottle. And also those almost Spring-like nights when you feel like shaking off the blankets and poking your feet out of the covers.Moisture wicking - As well as keeping you just the right temperature, linen bedlinen will also wick away moisture from your skin.This keeps you even more comfortable as there’s no nasty sweaty feeling. Great for damp late-winter nights and misty mornings when you’ve had quite enough of feeling soggy.Easy to dry - You can still hang washing out to dry at this time of year, but you just have to keep an eye on the weather. Having bedlinen that dries quickly is a bonus when days are short and sunshine is sparse. Linen is quicker to dry than other fabrics and can also be tumble dried.Wide range of colours - if you are thinking of investing in some new linen duvet covers or bedsheets we have a huge range to choose from. Add a pure wool throw for extra snuggliness and to bring more texture and colour to your room.Long-lasting - Not only will linen bedlinen always be in style, it will also last a lifetime. Spending a bit more at first on some top quality linenwares means you actually save in the long term. Linen is durable, and even gets softer and more cosy with each wash. A sumptuous set of linen bedlinen will not only see you through the next few seasons, but will last for many years to come.At LinenMe we are committed to being as sustainable as possible in the production of our linen home textiles. Linen itself is a great environmentally-friendly material thanks to its durability (meaning less discarded items), the fact that fewer resources are needed to grow and process flax, and its biodegradability.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91YIWrFElgL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"LinenMe","source_asin":"B07XHC37SG","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-525018","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07XHC37SG","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07XHC37SG","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
