window.products.push({"id":525089,"name":"Rtic Stainless Steel Bottle (18oz)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":32.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51f4xQWYMUL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"Keep your drinks ice-cold or piping-hot for longer in the RTIC Coolers 18 oz. Stainless Steel Double Vacuum Insulated Bottle. It has double wall vacuum insulation that seals in the temperature to keep drinks hot longer while it preserves ice for up to 24 hours and keeping drinks cold for hours! The heavy-duty lid has an air tight lid which locks in the cold. Durable and easy to clean this bottle is a perfect option for bringing your drink along wherever you may be going!Double wall vacuum insulation for maximum temperature retentionExtra wide opening for easy filling drinking and cleaningKeeps drinks cold drinks colder and hot drinks hotter for a longer period of timeHeavy-duty lid has an air tight seal which locks in the cold while providing an easy to carry loop top100% leak proof cap provides a three finger gripNo sweat exterior stays dry so you wont need for a coasterStrong and reliable 18/8 stainless steel construction","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51f4xQWYMUL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"RTIC","source_asin":"B01GS9MUGI","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-525089","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01GS9MUGI","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01GS9MUGI","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":525090,"name":"HGOD DESIGNS Eiffel Tower Round Wall Clock,Vintage French Paris Eiffel Tower Cityscape Art Design Silent Round Wall Clock Home Wall Decorative for Bed","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":34.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61d2X-BlKGL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"Size: 10inch diameter. This is a silent non-tick electronic wall clock (requires 1 \"AA\" battery, not included) . Stylish and innovative oil painting wall clocks can also be displayed on the table and decorated for office, kitchen, living room, bedroom, bathroom, classroom, guest room or dining room. Can be wall-mounted or equipped with a base stand , can be used as a desktop accessory or easily placed in the bedroom, living room or any place you like, it will bring you a different surprise . Uploading photos or pictures of your favorite life can also beautify your environment as meaningful gifts and souvenirs.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61d2X-BlKGL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"HGOD DESIGNS","source_asin":"B086JRNJK2","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-525090","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B086JRNJK2","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B086JRNJK2","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":525091,"name":"Cuisinart TOB-165 Convection Toaster Oven and Broiler, White","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41V2C7TGFCL._AC_.jpg","description":"Product description Exact Heat Sensor maintains precise oven temperature / 0.5 cubic foot oven capacity / White Finish Fast, easy and efficient broiling Includes Broiling pan and Slide-out crumb tray 4 Perfect Timing Custom Settings 0.5 cubic foot oven capacity Easy-to-clean oven interior 2-position oven rack Automatically shuts off after 4 hours of continuous use 3-year limited manufacturer's warranty White Finish Amazon.com Compact and loaded with electronic controls, this 0.5-cubic-foot countertop convection toaster oven/broiler has room to toast four slices, roast a 4-1/2-pound chicken, bake a 9-inch pie, or broil several steaks. Because it circulates hot air, the 1500-watt oven cooks faster and more uniformly than a conventional oven. For easy cleaning, the interior is nonstick and a slide-out tray catches toast crumbs. The exterior is steel painted white. The oven measures 14 inches wide, 9-1/4 inches high, and 17 inches deep, weighs 20-1/2 pounds, and carries a three-year warranty against defects. It comes with a rack that fits in two positions and a baking pan with a broiler insert. For safety, the oven automatically shuts off after 4 hours. A touchpad control panel runs the width of the oven and offers many options, including time and temperature, for all cooking methods. Toasting controls, for example, include buttons for number of items, defrosting, and bagels. Up to seven customized settings can be programmed into the toaster's memory so they can be conveniently recalled. Combining, say, the four-slice option, the defrost option, and the bagel option in the memory allows for defrosting and toasting four frozen bagel halves to a desired shade at the touch of a button without having to reprogram the toaster. --Fred Brack","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41V2C7TGFCL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Cuisinart","source_asin":"B00004YNX2","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-525091","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00004YNX2","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00004YNX2","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
