window.products.push({"id":525335,"name":"Kids Alarm Clock with Dinosaur, Digital Alarm Clock for Kids Bedroom, Cute Bedside Clock Children's Sleep Trainier, Wake Up Light and Night Light with","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":22.79,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61PnSfrDSZS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"🌈【Dream Night-light & Sleep Trainer】The cute dinosaur alarm clock is a good trainer to help children sleep alone at night. With cute dinosaur lamp with soft colorful lights, you don’t need to worry about your kid’s fear. You can set the light time from 1- 60mins freely as your kids like. ⏰【Flexible Alarm Setting】The digital alarm clock has two alarm choice, You can set different alarm clocks according to different dates to distinguish workday and weekends. For example: You can set the alarm from Monday to Friday, from Monday to Saturday or from Monday to Sunday. When the alarm rings, Press the light button to get 5 minutes snooze time, press any button to quit snooze. The alarm will ring again when the 5 minutes over and it will repeat for 3 times. 🔋【Energy Saving Model & USB Charging】The kids alarm clocks is an energy saving design. The screen closes with no action for saving the energy, you can evoke it by speaking loudly, tapping at the table or clapping hands, etc. The digital clock can be charged from the computer or the socket with the USB port, Three hours of charging can achieve super long standby. 🌤️【Intelligent Sunrise & Sunset Simulation】The alarm clock digital comes with sunrise & sunset mode and the wake up light alarm clock will turn from dark to bright during 6:00AM-5:59PM, which wake you from deep sleep and to give you a good mood in the morning. From 6:00PM-5:59AM, the LED will auto change to be dimmer to give you the best night's sleep environment. 💝【The Best Gift for Kids】Cute dinosaur alarm clock with the smart function can not only be used to decorate the room, but also develop the ability of children to sleep independently. The lovely dinosaur alarm clock is popular among children and is a great birthday and holiday gifts for children, very suitable for bedrooms, children's night lights, leisure, outdoor camping.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61PnSfrDSZS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"AnRuk","source_asin":"B0991VLF8Z","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-525335","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0991VLF8Z","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0991VLF8Z","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
