window.products.push({"id":525357,"name":"Sweese 813.119 Kitchen Utensil Holder, Utensil Crock with Hole - 7 Inches Porcelain Utensil Caddy - Easy to Dry and Prevent Tipping Over, Vibrant Yell","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61tNm6JK6ML._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"JUST COME HERE! STOP LOOKING - Sweese Serving Utensil Crock is Worth! A Visual Knockout - Simple Design SIZE: 6(W)*7(H) Inch—Grab one easily without pulling the rest out. CAPACITY: Up to 20+ Utensils HEAVY ENOUGH: Prevent being knocked over while removing utensils. New Design - Ventilation The holes of the kitchen holder will keep your spatulas drying, with NO odor! NOTE: it hasn't a hole at the bottom Dishwasher Safe Sweese kitchen utensil crock is made of durable porcelain. It is made from kaolin clay. It is fired at temperatures in excess of 1,300 degrees Celsius and is fully vitrified, which makes it much sturdy than stoneware. Without containing any chemical, more healthy than other materials. Gift For Your Friends It is well wrapped in a box, makes an awesome present for a gift for house-warming, wedding or anniversary.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61tNm6JK6ML._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Sweese","source_asin":"B093Q82L2N","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-525357","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B093Q82L2N","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B093Q82L2N","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":525358,"name":"Leggett & Platt Fenton Metal Headboard Panel with Gentle Curves, Black Walnut Finish, Full","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71ykLETQnxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Product Description The clean lines of the Fenton are reminiscent of great architectural styles of the past and provide a neutral backdrop for any designer's imagination. Constructed of carbon steel for stability and years of everyday use, the gentle curve and alternating length slats of the 49.75-inch headboard playfully suggests a lightness that makes this bedroom piece a perfect fit in any size room. The multi-step, hand-applied Black Walnut finish embodies a brushed “antiquing” look. A good ornamental headboard, like the Fenton, will fuse with the surrounding décor, accent other bedroom furniture and transform an ordinary room into something interesting and sophisticated. The clean and calming simplistic style will provide that stunning centerpiece needed in your master suite or guestroom. This unit includes a headboard panel, leg extensions, instruction sheet, and hardware bag with everything needed for easy assembly. The Leggett & Platt Fenton Headboard comes with a 10-year limited warranty against manufacturing defects. Leggett & Platt Inc. is an industry leader in the production of adjustable bases, fashionable beds, bedding support, and top of bed textiles. By keeping a close eye on the design community and other fashion and decorating sources, Leggett & Platt stays on top of the trends and knows the right mix of finishes, innovative designs, and technology to continually provide quality crafted products at an exceptional value. Leggett & Platt Consumer Products: Value Without Compromise Amazon.com Like a treasured find in an old farmhouse or grandma's attic, the Fenton metal headboard combines sweet simplicity with sturdy elegance. This lovely design features an open grill lined with mixed-length rails that work together to support a double top arch. The wider corner posts along with the round finials, joints, and feet lend a substantial feel, while the narrower accent rails keep the look delicate and airy. Available in several finishes to complement any room's color scheme, this Black Walnut version showcases a two-tone blend of deep mocha brown with distressed black highlights for a rich, bold statement. A final coat of clear lacquer adds a bit of sheen and maintenance-free durability. The full-sized headboard measures approximately 54-1/4 inches wide by 1-1/4 inches deep by 49-5/8 inches high. Fashion Bed Group backs the bed with a 10-year limited warranty. --Kara Karll","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71ykLETQnxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Fashion Bed Group","source_asin":"B076BC65JY","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-525358","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B076BC65JY","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B076BC65JY","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
