window.products.push({"id":525418,"name":"Wilton Lil Cowboy Cake Pan 502-3363","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":19.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/519z8F1pytL._AC_.jpg","description":"The contouring of the pan outlines the form and provides a generous backing to hold the cake. Crafted of quality aluminum, this bakeware heats evenly and keeps interiors moist while allowing surfaces to gently brown. Lightweight yet durable, it also retains its shape and transfers detailing clearly to the food surface. When the party is over, the pan cleans easily so there's less time spent in the kitchen washing up. The pan holds one box of cake mix and comes complete with baking and decorating instructions.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/519z8F1pytL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Wilton","source_asin":"B004PLXG1K","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-525418","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B004PLXG1K","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B004PLXG1K","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":525419,"name":"Summer Woods Flocked Blacklight Poster Art Print 36 x 24in","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":12.34,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71RCeAUfoUL._AC_SL1143_.jpg","description":"Summer Woods Blacklight Poster , 35 inches x 23 inches, standard sized. This poster image features a scenic view of a tree and ground covered forest in the middle of summer showing off all of its greenness.Printed in the USA with highly fluorescent inks and black flocking. Blacklight posters make great decoration for bedrooms, college dorm rooms, parties, entertainment rooms, or wherever you need a splash of color or glow.A flocked poster has black fibers that feel felt-like. The black appears much darker than an ink with no glare and gives great contrast to the fluorescent UV reactive inks. The poster has a 3/4 inch (1.9 cm white border around the whole poster, which is normal for screen printed blacklight posters. The posters get pulled through the printing press by this border and the area cannot be printed.Blacklight not included and is required to see the poster fluoresce or glow in the dark. Image under blacklight is for reference only, results may vary depending on type of blacklight (ultraviolet fixture or bulb) used.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71RCeAUfoUL._AC_SL1143_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Opticz","source_asin":"B009H48CE6","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-525419","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B009H48CE6","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B009H48CE6","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":525420,"name":"FreeLee - Bruce Lee Poster Frame | Unique Dynamic Bruce Lee Wall Art | Martial Arts Decorations Office or Dojo-Of-A-Kind Gift Bruce Lee Fans (10 x 5.2","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":19.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81b0nLlPfVL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Yes, that IS a Bruce Lee poster of him kicking through the frame. Bruce Lee was an icon for many and as a result, there’s alot of motivational artwork featuring him, but to us they presented a big problem. They are all very “cookie cutter”, and many of them aren’t true to who Bruce Lee really was off camera. So we created Free Lee, Bruce Lee wall art that is guaranteed to be a unique addition to your collection!You might be surprised to find out that Bruce Lee was not the loud and boisterous action hero he was always depicted as in hollywood. Even in interviews, he’s depicted as a sage whose words are often used as copy-paste “Bruce Lee inspirational quotes”. We wanted Free Lee to showcase a more honest form of a calm and focused Bruce Lee, a silent observer letting his actions speak for themselves. In the words of one of our supporters, “I think he would get a ‘kick’ out of this Bruce Lee art. It’s fun without being disrespectful.”We’ve taken painstaking measures to ensure our martial arts decoration’s message stays clear and the quality exceeds expectations. The artwork of Bruce Lee in this framed poster was created by a professional artist with years of experience. The picture is custom printed with industrial manufacturing techniques to give it high strength, great resolution, and a protective gloss finish, better than you would get with high quality business cards. The frame was designed and is manufactured in the heart of New York and they’re made with lightweight and strong plastic. The 10 inch x 5.25 inch profile means you can hang it anywhere, with anything, securely and safely.Give Free Lee as a gift for a loved one or yourself, the gift of motivational artwork. Let Free Lee inspire you to break free of the barriers and self doubt that hold you back from the life you deserve. Let it serve as a reminder to act in spite of the negative thoughts and obstacles on your path, rather than succumb to them.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81b0nLlPfVL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Generic","source_asin":"B09WCZQQQM","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-525420","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09WCZQQQM","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09WCZQQQM","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
