window.products.push({"id":525608,"name":"Department 56 Christmas in the CityA Little Irish Jig Village Accessory, 2.25 inch","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51ZCygtbK2L._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"Christmas In The City-a collection from Department 56-with all the hustle and bustle, this series captures the elegance and excitement of the city. This talented lad entertains at Murphy's Irish Pub every weekend. Hand-crafted and hand-painted porcelain figurine accessory.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51ZCygtbK2L._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Department 56","source_asin":"B007MNSNZ2","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-525608","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B007MNSNZ2","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B007MNSNZ2","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":525609,"name":"Large Butter Dish – Enamelware Container, Beech Wood Lid and Stainless Steel Spreading Knife, Handmade for Country Style Kitchen – Large One Pound of ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61Ivs3QzcrL._AC_SL1010_.jpg","description":"A BIG SIZE Butter Container to Fit 4 STICKS OF BUTTER For people who appreciate the taste of real butter, you need a proper butter keeper. Why? Fresh butter need not be airtight sealed and placed in the fridge. It is made for eating within a matter of days and enjoying its freshness. This is how it should taste. A traditional butter boat lid does not sit tightly, it rests on top of the bowl and helps to make the butter smooth and spreadable. The beech wood lid can be used to place butter, ready for slicing – this of course may mark it but is an option for traditionalists. NO MORE FRAGILE PORCELAIN OR GLASS In the old days butter was a central part of cooking and your butter dish had to withstand a lot of work, a lot of passing around and a busy kitchen. It needed to last. This boat is built in the same traditional way. It also had to be a wide butter dish to be mess free. EASY TO CLEAN But do so by hand. This is an old-world charm butter dish, before microwaves and dishwashers, so please do not place it in one of them, it will not be happy and likely be scarred for life. Air dry but not in direct sunlight.  Please do not submerge the lid in water, it will likely warp it. Simply use a damp cloth and dry by hand. THE CENTREPIECE TO A GREAT FAMILY THANKSGIVING/CHRISTMAS PARTY Imagine it now; a perfect roast turkey, mashed potatoes, glazed carrots, someone asking “pass the butter please” do you shriek back in horror at the plastic tub of margarine sitting there or proudly reach for your uniquely glazed butter dish holding two slabs of Finest European Butter.. Enjoy!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61Ivs3QzcrL._AC_SL1010_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Cuina","source_asin":"B06XL12QXL","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-525609","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B06XL12QXL","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B06XL12QXL","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":525610,"name":"H&F 12 OZ Can Cooler, Slim Stainless Steel Cans Insulators for Beverage Energy Drinks Beers and Soda (Off-White)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/4105ovwcanS._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"The slim can cooler is the go-to item for tailgating, road trips, and keeping canned beers cold longer than ever before. Great for parties, beach, birthdays, bbqs, camping, outdoors, sporting events, picnics and other daily use.VACUUM INSULATED The vacuum insulation technology reaches maximum temperature retention. EASY STORAGE Slim design is good for putting it in your handbag for travel or outdoor use. DISHWASHER SAFE Top rack dishwasher safe for added convenience. GREAT GIFT With gift package, it is perfect to give it to your friends and families as gifts on Mother's DayFather's DayValentine's DayChristmas or any holidays. Package includes: 1 x White Can Cooler","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/4105ovwcanS._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"H&F","source_asin":"B08VJ3X69F","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-525610","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08VJ3X69F","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08VJ3X69F","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":525611,"name":"AcrylicGiftware Clear Acrylic Napkin Ring and Bud Vase Combo 2-in-1 Flower Holder (Set of 8) (AGW-4416-8)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":35.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41xymQCwrhL._AC_.jpg","description":"Our acrylic 2-In-1 Napkin Ring / Bud Vase combination (8 individual pcs.) is perfect for any occasion regardless if formal or next to the pool. Call it Retro, Mod or just Classic, this highly unbreakable and extremely attractive table topper will evoke comments from everyone who sees it. Acrylic is the same compound used to make a combat jet fighter canopy and clear walls at hockey rinks so you know how tough it is. Use it as is or add just a few drops of water and a petit flower and “presto”, the talk of the table. Additionally, acrylic will not fade or yellow from the sun or interior lighting so the clear, polished finished will look good for years to come. Ideal for wedding & event planners, use outdoors by the pool, when having a formal dinner and used extensively by the catering and rental industry, this set comes poly-bagged in a white gift box. We additionally offer discounts for larger volume purchases. Bud Vase measures 1\" deep so it's free-standing - 2.25\" tall and 1.88\" wide and the total shipping weight per set is about a half a pound excluding the exterior shipping box and interior protective padding. Easy to clean, simply hand wash in warm water with liquid soap (no scrub or harsh rubbing is suggested or required), “pat dry” to eliminate exterior water spots and turn upside down to allow any moisture in the bud vase to drain. Acrylic is tough to crack, craze or break, however, occasionally it may scratch slightly if mishandled. If that happens you probably have the fix already at home. Place a tiny dab of toothpaste on top of the affected area, place a fingertip on top of that paste and press down just firmly enough to apply a little pressure but not too much to create more scratching. Rub the paste in a “swirl” pattern for a few seconds, rinse and pat dry. For light scratches that should do the trick.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41xymQCwrhL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"AcrylicGiftware","source_asin":"B09S374HD1","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-525611","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09S374HD1","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09S374HD1","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":525612,"name":"Crossing Seven Seas Blue Green Glass Sea Horse Figurine- Flame Work Glass Seahorse Sculpture- Underwater Art Glass Seahorse Sealife Animal Handmade Be","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81mruokF55L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"This is a beautiful handmade Blue and Green Glass Sea Horse . A perfect addition to your home. These majestic animals can sure brighten the look of your home. These figurines are made using the Flame work Technique. The vibrant colors make these majestic animals look so magnificent.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81mruokF55L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Crossing Seven Seas","source_asin":"B015X9L9H0","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-525612","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B015X9L9H0","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B015X9L9H0","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":525613,"name":"Washington Crossing Delaware River in 1776 by Emanuel Leutze, 14x24-Inch Canvas Wall Art","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71C25BvhW9L._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"This ready to hang, gallery-wrapped art piece features Washington crossing the Delaware River. With Images from over 8,000 collections and more than 29,000 artists, Bridgeman Art Library collection represents international museums, galleries and artists by providing a central source of fine art for image users.Every subject, concept, style and medium is represented: from the masterpieces of national museums to the hidden treasures of private collections.Bridgeman Art Library is the world's largest archive of fine art, cultural and historical stills and now footage available for licensing and reproduction. Giclee (jee-clay) is an advanced printmaking process for creating high quality fine art reproductions. The attainable excellence that Giclee printmaking affords makes the reproduction virtually indistinguishable from the original piece. The result is wide acceptance of Giclee by galleries, museums, and private collectors. Gallery wrap is a method of stretching an artist's canvas so that the canvas wraps around the sides and is secured a hidden, wooden frame. This method of stretching and preparing a canvas allows for a frameless presentation of the finished painting.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71C25BvhW9L._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Trademark Fine Art","source_asin":"B00GSPOLY2","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-525613","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00GSPOLY2","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00GSPOLY2","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
