window.products.push({"id":525675,"name":"Curtis Stone 'Keep It Clean' Spoon Rest With Spoon","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31G0XMcZiSL._AC_.jpg","description":"The ultimate assistant for mess-free cooking, the Curtis Stone \"Keep It Clean\" spoon rest of durable vitrified porcelain eliminates sticky countertops and prevents stains. Fill the bowl on this spoon rest with water and add your kitchen spoon between stirring marinara sauces, stews, mixing cheesy pasta or blending dessert ingredients. Finally, you can keep kitchen utensils both handy and clean as you cook. Curved easel-style handle steadies the Curtis Stone spoon rest, providing counterbalancing stability on a countertop. Elegant glazed white porcelain complements every kitchen decor. Durable spoon rest is resistant to stains and scratches. Includes heat-resistant silicone spoon. Dishwasher-safe.Celebrated chef of the popular U.S. reality/cooking show, \"Take home Chef,\" Curtis Stone designed his Kitchen Solutions culinary products to help home chefs create fresh, flavorful meals in less time. Classically trained by London's legendary chef, Marco Pierre White, Australian Curtis is the author and presenter of the internationally successful cooking program, \"Surfing the Menu.\" Reflecting Curtis passion to keep cooking simple and fun, the 'Keep It Clean' spoon rest makes it easier for you to prepare appetizers, entrees and desserts in the kitchen.\"I always wanted a spoon rest that could give me back a clean spoon each time I put it down. All it took was to design one that could hold water.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31G0XMcZiSL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Curtis Stone","source_asin":"B0063HZQGW","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-525675","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0063HZQGW","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0063HZQGW","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
