window.products.push({"id":525917,"name":"B-Qtech Electric Air Pump + Camping Lantern, 6 Nozzles Mini Air Pump for Inflatables, 2000MAh Rechargeable Battery Multifunctional Quick-Fill Inflate ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":27.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51MGNeZKjbL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【5 NOZZLES & DIVERSE USE】Come with 5 nozzles, compared with ordinary electric air pumps, it can adapt to more large and small inflation products, such as air mattresses, inflatable beds, pool floats, sleeping pads, swim rings, inflatable furniture, pool inflatables, and pumping vacuum storage bag. (Note: portable air pump not applicable to balloons, tires, football, basketball, etc.) 【ULTRA-MINI SIZE & PORTABLE】Weight: 3.35 oz. Size: 1.77*1.77*2.56 inch. The portable air pump is mini as an egg and light-weighted. The compact design makes the electric air pump lightweight and does not take up too much space. It is easy to carry and take whether it is used in the family swimming pool or outdoor camping travel. This rechargeable mini air pump must be your good assistant for outdoor entertainment! 【POWERFUL INFLATION/DEFLATION】Powerful 3.5 kPa air pressure, 35000rpm high speed motor, it has a more efficient and faster inflation experience than ordinary electric air pump. After one charge, you can charge 45 swimming rings and only takes 50 seconds to fill one swim ring, or deflate the vacuum storage bag with larger capacity, which will greatly save your time. 【PRACTICAL CAMPING LIGHT】The portable inflator pump comes with a camping light at the bottom, with 8 light beads providing powerful brightness and a wide range of lighting effects. 3-level brightness adjustment: High(400 lumen)/Medium(120 Lumen). 3 kinds lighting model (weak light/ strong light/ SOS model), adapt to your different camping needs, even have light warnings. The electric air pump can provide continuous lighting for 7.5 hours when fully charged. 【2000mAh RECHARGEABLE BATTERY】2000mA rechargeable battery surpasses most rechargeable air pumps on the market. Bring the mini air pump with you, no need of socket or outdoor power supply. TYPE-C charging line leaves the trouble and cramped charging mode of the traditional wired electric air pump, you can fully charge the air pump in advance, or recharge the air pump with a power bank, computer or car anytime and anywhere.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51MGNeZKjbL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"B-Qtech","source_asin":"B0C5M8JD8P","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-525917","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0C5M8JD8P","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0C5M8JD8P","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
