window.products.push({"id":525961,"name":"Bormioli Rocco Fido Jar .35 Litter (11.75 Ounce) Round with Clear Lid","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":17.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/316ObCr9D0L._AC_.jpg","description":"The Borimoli Rocco Fido Cylinder Collection has updated the traditional iconic squared canning jar to a 0.35-liter Fido Jar to a cylindrical shape adding more food storage options to the jars. The \"half-pint\" 11.75-ounce jar's cylindrical body is designed specifically for freezing food preservation and dry storage needs. The Fido Cylinder Collection is ideal for the traditional pasteurizing and air-tight preserving techniques. Use in the freezer, in the pantry, or on the countertop for dry, fresh, or leftover foods. They're also great as gift containers for homemade delicacies. The Bormioli Rocco Glass Fido Jar is suitable for storing just about anything with an air-tight hinged lid with a natural rubber gasket. This 4-inch tall jar needn't be confined to the pantry. Pair the cylindrical fido jar with other Fido jars as countertop canisters to display your dry baking and cooking supplies. The Fido Cylinder Collection glass storage jars' function goes far beyond the kitchen. Utilize the jars for organizing craft materials, bathroom supplies, gift packaging for homemade goods such as bath salts, sugar scrubs, and goodies. There are so many fun possibilities--your imagination only limits you! Sold as a single glass Fido jar Sold as a single glass Fido jar Fill Capacity: 35cl - 6.75 oz. Fill Capacity: 35cl - 6.75 oz. Height with lid engaged: 100 mm - 4\" Height with lid engaged: 100 mm - 4\" Diameter: 98.4 mm - 3 .75\" Diameter: 98.4 mm - 3 .75\" Freezer Safe to -4°F (-20°C ) Freezer Safe to -4°F (-20°C ) Hinged jar lid with replaceable rubber gasket Hinged jar lid with replaceable rubber gasket Air-tight seal Air-tight seal Made of soda-lime glass with natural rubber gasket Made of soda-lime glass with natural rubber gasket Glass parts of the jar are dishwasher safe. Glass parts of the jar are dishwasher safe. Hand washing is recommended for metal closer and gasket. Hand washing is recommended for metal closer and gasket. Made in Italy Made in Italy About Bormioli RoccoSince 1825 Bormioli Rocco has made glass to give your food stories their best setting. At Bormioli Rocco, they believe in the table as the place where some of the most profound and most authentic relationships are created, revived, and celebrated.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/316ObCr9D0L._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Bormioli Rocco","source_asin":"B01FN1Y4AM","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-525961","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01FN1Y4AM","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01FN1Y4AM","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
