window.products.push({"id":525964,"name":"MOYMO Reversible Loveseat Cover,Loveseat Slipover with Strap,Loveseat Protector with Pockets,Machine Washable Loveseat Covers for Livingroom,Children,","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81ParCC7GIL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Measure before ordering. Refer to our measuring guide in our photos. You should know that loveseat Covers are going to make cleaning up messes much easier. Whether your dog urinates or eats on the couch, they’re going to create a mess. With a cover, you’ll be able to fix the problem quickly and conveniently. Why We Need a loveseat Cover Loveseat covers for dogs is an awesome way to keep your loveseat protected, and can also double as a decorative piece. If you are paranoid about your loveseat getting stains from food and kiddos or getting clawed and torn up by pets, a loveseat cover is the perfect way to keep your loveseat protected. Or, if you have an older loveseat that needs a fresh look, a reversible loveseat cover can make the loveseat feel like new again. MOYMO Furniture Protectors Are The Great Choice Which You can’t refuse - loveseat cover side pockets: Our loveseat covers have 2 big and 4 small pockets for storing magazines,newspapers,remotes and other small essentials, they’re always close at hand when you’re lounging out. - Straightforward To Use: One-piece design that put on and off with ease. The loveseat Covers with 2\" wide adjustable elastic straps which will make loveseat covers more tight. - Easy change,easy wash: Quilted slipcovers are made of Polyester material which will prevent spilling and stain.Easy to throw into the washing machine to clean. - Guarantee: 0 risk.Any questions,anytime for this loveseat cover can be solved by our MOYMO Customer Service Specifications: - Loveseat Cover Size:76”x114”(Arm to Arm) - Color: Black/Dark Grey Dark Grey/Grey Navy Blue/Brown Chocolate/Beige Burgudy/Beige - Loveseat Cover Weight:2.65lb Package Contents: - 1 x Loveseat Cover -1 x Strap","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81ParCC7GIL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"MOYMO","source_asin":"B07QVNW3K6","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-525964","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07QVNW3K6","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07QVNW3K6","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
